FILE: stories.rs
MOD: commands/stories
OWNS: story flow verification — checks declared flows in system.arch against actual import connections
PROFILE: [io, pure-core]
CHANGE-FREQUENCY: volatile

run: bool → Result<(), String> [io, boundary]
  calls: ArchContext::load, ctx::load_stories, depgraph::build_dep_graph, verify_story_pairs
  note: build_dep_graph called with resolve_self=true (includes same-container connections)

verify_story_pairs: &[String] * &HashMap<String,HashSet<String>> * bool → (usize, usize, usize, Vec<Value>) [pure]
  note: container refs (no '/') are skipped not failed; same-container pairs count as connected

DEPENDS-ON: context, depgraph

KEY-INVARIANTS:
- resolve_self=true is required — stories span containers and same-container module pairs must resolve; using false (as fitness does) would produce false gap failures

